==================================================

Include an optional, editable directory of inspiration destinations.

Requested starter suggestions:
- Pinterest: broad visual inspiration.
- Ravelry: knitting and crochet patterns, yarn-related project exploration.
- DMC: embroidery and cross-stitch pattern browsing.
- Instructables: broad DIY and craft tutorials.
